# The repository holds source, not build output. Programs and compiled scripts are produced when a release is built.
# To run the scripts from a clone: download nwnsc 1.1.5 (see KotoR/Docs/PROVENANCE.md) and put nwnsc.exe in KotoR/Source/tools/nwnsc/,
# then compile the scripts with KotoR/Source/scripts/build_scripts.py.
*.exe
*.dll
*.ncs

# Python caches, logs and build leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.obj
*.pcode
